ttps://tr.rbxcdn.com/5b568a415c222aaed72f2d239341ea16/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/5b568a415c222aaed72f2d239341ea16/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/5b568a415c222aaed72f2d239341ea16/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2024-09-10T13:00:00.731Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-10T13:00:00.731Z","lastBump":"2024-09-10T13:00:00.731Z","script":"local x = 10 -- How big is X \n    local z = 10 -- How big is Z\nlocal wait = 2 -- adjust when will this water turn into freeze machine\n\nif not setclipboard then\ngame:GetService(\"StarterGui\"):SetCore(\"SendNotification\",{\nTitle = \"ur exec does not support setclipboard\",\nText = \"change setclipboard to print or use an online Lua editor and copy\", \n\nButton1 = \"k\",\nButton2 = \"nah\",\nDuration = 30 \n})\nend\n\nlocal function chat(msg)\n    game.Players:Chat(msg)\nend\n    \n-- DO NOT ADJUST Y!\n\n    local chatCommand = \"\" -- add anything\n    for i = 1, 30 do\n        chatCommand = chatCommand .. \":makepart \" .. i .. \"|\"\n    end\n     for i = 1, 30 do\n        chatCommand = chatCommand .. \":setcollision \" .. i .. \" false|\"\n    end\n    for i = 1, 30 do\n        chatCommand = chatCommand .. \":resizepart \" .. i .. \" exact \" .. x .. \" 2040 \" .. z .. \"|\"\n    end\n    for i = 1, 30 do\n        chatCommand = chatCommand .. \":movepart \" .. i .. \" relative 0 \" .. (i - 1) * 2000 .. \" 0|\"\n    end\n    chatCommand = chatCommand .. \":thaw|:wait \".. wait ..\"|\"\n    for i = 1, 30 do\n        chatCommand = chatCommand .. \":terrainpart \" .. i .. \" Water|\"\n    end\n        chatCommand = chatCommand .. \":wtransparency 1|:wcolor 255,255,0\"\n\nsetclipboard(chatCommand)\nprint(chatCommand) -- print has been made for you incase if you need to use lua editor","features":"!!! THIS IS NOT KOHLS ADMIN HOUSE !!! (this admin house better)\n- works for all executor. because this is just command making\n\nThis script make a water glitch that can freeze people roblox cilent when players enter the water. (have issue to force quit roblox for over 15 seconds)\n\nImportant:\n\n- Use an alt account, as you risk a permanent ban from the game by admin.\n- The larger the water area, the longer the load time.\n- Some people might use different types of crashes to freeze your roblox cilent, this is called mesh crashing, so be cautious (though this is now rare now due to ban system)\nhttps://kaderth.fandom.com/wiki/Erystant_aka._Crash_mesh\n\nHow to Use:\nFirst, get admin. then execute the script. now you have commands to make water. You have three options to execute the command\n (I can automate the script to execute command, but the command is too long so im unable to do this):\n\n1. Type :cmdbox, paste the code, and click \"Execute.\"\n2. Click ' keybind and paste the code.\n3. Type /e before the code. For example: /e :kill me.","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61ffbfda7637b9de22ca0e30","username":"AHcrasher","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4eeb9c784eea21acc43151362f136691a311cbd4e3e7cb3cccf95f03131a991f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61ffbfda7637b9de22ca0e30-1725972123281.png"},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"61ffbfda7637b9de22ca0e30","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4eeb9c784eea21acc43151362f136691a311cbd4e3e7cb3cccf95f03131a991f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61ffbfda7637b9de22ca0e30-1725972123281.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T03:14:46.595Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4cb8d","editBy":{"_id":"61ffbfda7637b9de22ca0e30","username":"AHcrasher",